Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.83,0:00:39.63,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1490,872,1510,886,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:37.77,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,It's like a graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.51,0:01:40.88,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,No heat sources or radar waves detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:43.68,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{shuri}There are no signs of repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:47.09,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,They're just drifting lifelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:51.00,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Maybe that's all they're capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:56.67,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,They can destroy, but can't repair or create.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.33,0:01:59.99,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,So, what's the plan ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:04.28,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's too risky to wait here \Nuntil the rescue fleet arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:07.03,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The Yamato can transport the refugees to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:10.05,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,That's what we should do, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.53,0:02:13.51,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,That'll disrupt the schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.20,0:02:15.61,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,There's another option.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.15,0:02:20.48,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,1800 light years from here in the direction of Telezart...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:23.48,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Planet Stravase...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:28.76,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,A Garmillas fleet bound for Earth \Nwill pass near this planet tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.16,0:02:32.95,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Ask the fleet to transport the refugees to Earth ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:38.43,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,It's on a routine trip from Garmillas\N to Earth with no immediate concerns.{pressing matters.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.43,0:02:41.32,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{jijo}If we explain the situation they\N should agree to rendezvous with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.63,0:02:46.87,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Telezart is asking for help.\N The Yamato should move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:03:02.01,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,More than 200 people were saved, \Nbut ten times that were killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:05.88,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{toshiyori}...whether they were elders or children.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.72,0:03:11.05,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,That's who our enemy is, and you let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:15.73,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of promise \Nyou made on Iscandar, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:19.39,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,...I want you to remember what I just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.91,0:03:50.94,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:55.23,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,He said it's on a routine \Ntrip from Garmillas to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:57.43,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Planet Stravase is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.90,0:04:01.32,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Alright. I want to confirm\N the chart on the main bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.89,0:04:02.39,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:04.39,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm sor...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.91,0:04:17.76,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:25.97,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Kodai...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.22,0:04:27.99,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Doctor !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:33.57,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Kodai looks upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:35.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Doctor Sado !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:38.54,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Please don't talk so loudly in the sick bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:42.34,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Identify yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.87,0:04:48.50,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Mori Yuki of the Earth Defense Force Central Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.19,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You weren't on the crew manifest.{list.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:54.63,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Well, I just forgot to register...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.63,0:04:58.26,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I can't maintain military discipline like this. \NYou need to leave the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:00.95,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Alright. I'll leave the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:04.16,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Oh c'mon, both of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:06.12,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Doctor, you don't have time. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:12.46,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,It's my fault, okay ?\N Fighting's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:17.18,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}All hands, departure is scheduled at 11:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.18,0:05:23.02,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Personnel from each operation department must \Nconfirm your assigned civilian section by 09:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:35.16,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,W...what are you doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.85,0:05:38.09,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm leaving the ship just like you ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.05,0:05:40.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What are you talking about ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:43.35,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,How are you going to get back to Earth from here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.85,0:05:46.28,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,You're the one who told me to leave the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:48.76,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'll space-walk or whatever to get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:51.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Mori, I have an order for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.93,0:05:57.21,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Doctor Sado.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:05:58.82,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,What is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:06.04,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,I feel like Okita is still on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:11.13,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Yes, he's with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:17.28,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,But they're all young.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:20.53,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,They need an adult who can support them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:24.34,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Well, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:35.49,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,I'm just a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:43.47,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,You're a wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:48.84,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,You're looking tense from every angle. \NYou'll stress yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.41,0:06:51.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.23,0:06:57.43,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Hey Kodai, when the SOS came\N from Telezart, we all saw a vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:00.63,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Show your resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.53,0:07:08.33,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,If we didn't see it, do you think everyone \Nwould have gotten on board the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:17.24,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,You blew your cover ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:22.16,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Sorry for all the trouble you \Nguys went through to hide me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.73,0:07:23.68,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:27.33,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,The bond among the Yamato's female crew is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.33,0:07:28.56,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,But why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.08,0:07:31.73,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I wanted to breathe the air outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.73,0:07:32.74,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:38.53,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,There's a limit to things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.74,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,You mean Kodai ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.47,0:07:46.04,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I guess it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:54.63,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I know I'm no use even if I'm not hiding, \Nbut I don't want to be a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.63,0:07:58.39,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{kaere}If he tells me to go home, I will, but before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.55,0:08:05.40,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,...I wanted to tell him I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:13.86,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,I'm envious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.01,0:08:20.58,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Mori wasn't called by Telezart, \Nbut she still came aboard anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:21.83,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Why do you think she did that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:23.83,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You knew ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:29.30,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Be true to yourself. It's not \Nshameful to depend on someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:33.52,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,You can bring up military discipline\N all you want, but this is the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:37.32,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,I'll look the other way, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:08:59.28,def2,MASER,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:00.77,def2,MASER,0,0,0,,Damn you, Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:09.44,def2,MASER,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me ?\N What is this irrational rage ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:12.93,def2,MASER,0,0,0,,Yamato...Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:18.82,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,200 million km to Stravase.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:29.95,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Mori Yuki reporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.53,0:09:37.14,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,As soon as we arrive at Stravase, the Deputy Commander will board the Garmillas ship for the final arrangements.{check-up.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:39.45,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{mondai}If there are no problems,\N we'll begin the transfer immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:45.77,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{minkan}The civilians and Space Cavalry members will be split up\Nbetween the three Garmillas ships and head back to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:49.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{insotsu}Once again, I'm assigning you to escort duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.48,0:09:51.09,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Order acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:05.98,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,We'll be transferred to a\N Garmillas ship on that planet, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:10.24,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Even though the Garmillans\N are with us, are we really safe ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.33,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:14.69,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,But, I'll be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:15.78,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:18.68,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,We'll be with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:22.18,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Let's set foot on the \NEarth's surface together, okay ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:26.41,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,If you're with us, Commander...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.97,0:10:28.41,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,That'll be a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.23,0:10:30.41,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.04,0:10:33.53,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I have to hurry back, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.31,0:10:41.09,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Our commander believes that \Nvengeance is all that's left in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.52,0:10:44.18,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Umm, Mr. Saito...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:11:00.28,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,A responsible and attractive woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:16.38,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.93,0:11:20.51,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,Those are the ruins of Stravase that\N I've heard about from the Garmillans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:26.33,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,{arewo}If we could study it, we might be able to solve\N the mystery of the ancient Archelias civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:27.28,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,{nanoni}Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.78,0:11:28.59,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.62,0:11:34.11,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,You'll have to create that opportunity yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.39,0:11:45.61,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,The Garmillas fleet is approaching\N the rendezvous point on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:00.99,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Please don't push. \NWe have plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.75,0:12:09.68,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:13.60,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We wish we could take our \Npeople back home ourselves, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.26,0:12:15.93,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,You can count on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:21.08,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Besides, Telezart is one of our biggest mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:23.93,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to what the Yamato discovers.{'s research results.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:28.09,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Oh, Lieutenant Keyman...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.59,0:12:32.23,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,About a substitute correspondent to take your post...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:35.34,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I'll return to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.88,0:12:37.34,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Thank you, Deputy Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.97,0:12:50.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,We're sorry for letting you take on a duty like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:54.16,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's unimportant. \NHave you obtained “it” ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:55.28,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:13:01.51,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,I never imagined your original plan of bringing the Yamato to us would come true this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:05.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It must be because of your blessed lineage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:07.68,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:10.68,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Things tend to happen unexpectedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:11.29,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.21,0:13:17.93,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,This is exactly what you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.93,0:13:22.36,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It can control or even destroy \Nthe Yamato's wave motion engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.75,0:13:25.45,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Anti-wave motion photon...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:31.11,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Please stay in line so you don't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.73,0:13:33.46,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.19,0:13:36.10,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,Ma'am !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:40.08,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,Are you getting on the ship, too ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:42.08,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.03,0:13:45.13,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,Can we meet again once we get to Earth ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.69,0:13:46.37,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.10,0:14:08.69,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,It's a bit heavy, but we \Ncan talk anytime with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.77,0:14:13.23,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,We can stay in contact with each other,\N even between two different ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.23,0:14:16.93,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{ichiichi}It's better than asking Garmillas to borrow a communication device every time, isn't it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.93,0:14:18.03,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:21.45,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,But is it okay for me to \Nuse equipment like this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:24.75,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,My commander insisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.63,0:14:32.17,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Goodbye over a cup of sake ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:36.92,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I don't understand why we \Nhave to say goodbye, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:42.33,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,The current Yamato has no fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:45.38,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,It doesn't have the spirit to fight our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:50.28,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,So I'll return to Earth and ask to be\N assigned to a ship with the spirit to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:52.44,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Don't you feel the same way ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:15:00.77,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,This is the ship my best friend risked his life for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.85,0:15:08.31,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Let me see it out until my last moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:34.11,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's about time for the refugees to depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:38.78,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Someone representing the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:41.03,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,...should probably hear a word or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.03,0:15:42.76,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Like, maybe from the Acting Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:45.24,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.78,0:16:00.78,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:07.11,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:22.99,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,The Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:25.59,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,That's Professor Redrowz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:32.32,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The ruins ?\N A civilian went off to the ruins ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.74,0:16:33.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I'll bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.78,0:16:36.21,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Please take care of the ship, Mr. Sanada.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:55.13,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Such a problem{major trouble} at a time like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:07.33,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What is this place ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.93,0:17:09.73,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Why did the Professor come here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:13.65,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Objects emerging from the gas clouds in orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:14.65,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,It's a fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:15.45,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.64,0:17:28.58,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Ships identified.\N They're Garmillas ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.58,0:17:29.54,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Garmillas ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:30.52,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,So many...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:32.52,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this, Keyman ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:41.33,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Missiles approaching rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.35,0:17:49.28,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.44,0:18:03.69,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Dead end ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:09.24,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Professor Redrowz, where are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:26.85,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Acting Captain, this is the Yamato !\NWe're under attack from enemy ships !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:34.31,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Watch out !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:35.53,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Commander !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:47.77,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Run !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:50.23,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Get to the Garmillas ship now !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:18:57.93,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Let's get back to the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:19:00.11,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Destructive Liberation Army...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.60,0:19:06.39,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}They're Garmillas political criminals\N who have rebelled against the home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:13.35,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}We had some skirmishes elsewhere, but I didn't expect them to appear on our route to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.45,0:19:21.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Desler's dead, but his hegemony \Nstill haunts Garmillas to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:25.87,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The planets overrun by Garmillas must be set free.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:30.19,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Now is the time to punish the rotten dictator.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.89,0:19:40.73,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}They're coming after us, but we can't move until we finish accommodating the civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:43.46,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}We need your help, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:44.58,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.98,0:19:46.81,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}You're the only one we can depend on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:51.87,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to face the fire ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.49,0:19:57.77,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Yamato's preparing to take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:03.15,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Good, otherwise it was pointless\N to lure a real rebel force here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.97,0:20:08.93,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Yamato will show some \Nweakness during the confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.93,0:20:11.15,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The rest is up to "him".
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.78,0:20:15.25,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}All hands, prepare for emergency take off !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:21.89,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I only have one chance at this\N when the wave motion engine starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.61,0:20:30.35,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Have we heard from the Acting Captain yet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.35,0:20:32.17,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,No, no response yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.17,0:20:34.17,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Search plane signal confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.43,0:20:37.59,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,They're back ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:40.47,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,As soon as they land, we'll take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.85,0:20:43.32,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Engine room, activate the flywheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.96,0:20:56.28,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Once it stops shaking, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.61,0:21:00.43,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.77,0:21:07.27,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Not there ?\N What do you mean by that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.99,0:21:10.43,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,A civilian piloted it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:13.33,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,No, no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.18,0:21:18.21,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai, where are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:26.39,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,Archelias. The ancient Archelians \Nare the origin of all humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.27,0:21:31.51,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,{karera}Why did you send your people to \Nso many corners of the galaxy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:36.44,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,{horobi}To nurture your successors\N upon the end of your civilization ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.95,0:21:41.09,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,{moshi}If so, why did you have to \Nmaintain the form of a human ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:43.09,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:48.97,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,Even though that form brought you death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.51,0:21:56.04,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,{osu}It's an irrational life form which can't\Nreproduce without mating male and female.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:22:00.78,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,{ubai}Steal, hate, kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:06.53,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,Humans are the chaos that\N disrupts the harmony of the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.79,0:22:10.08,def2,PROFESSOR,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.16,0:22:13.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.86,0:22:17.83,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,My name is Zorder...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.05,0:22:23.35,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...he who knows what love is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.13,0:22:31.40,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...more than anyone in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.38,0:22:44.30,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(212,874)}Episode 8
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.38,0:22:44.30,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(336,1046)}Trap on the Planet Stravase !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.13,0:22:58.48,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(1194,586)}Kodai Susumu:\NMori Yuki:\NShima Daisuke:\NSanada Shiro:\NNanbu Yasuo:\NAihara Yoshikazu:\NOhta Kenjiro:\NTokugawa Hikozaemon:\NSado Sakezo:\NSaijo Miki:\NHirata Hajime:\NShinohara Hiroki:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.13,0:22:58.48,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1230,104)}Ono Daisuke\NKuwashima Houko\NSuzumura Kenichi \NOtsuka Hochu\NAkabane Kenji \NKokubun Masato\NChiba Yuki\NMugihito\NChiba Shigeru\NMoriya Satomi\NIse Fumihide\NHirata Daisuke
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.48,0:23:07.33,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(1208,762)}Yamamoto Akira:\NSaeki Koji:\NShinoda Koto: \NSaito Hajime: \NShiori Nagakura: \NAmagi Toshiro:\NOkita Juzo:\NHijikata Ryu:\NRobert Redrowz:\NKatsuragi Touko:\NKeyman:\NKarzet:\NZorder: \NMaser: \NIry: \NMonk:\NSkipper:\NRefugee:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.48,0:23:07.33,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1244,44)}Tanaka Rie\NItatori Masaaki\NHara Yumi\NHiroki Tochi\NAmagai Kazusa\NSaito Jiro\NSugao Takayuki\NIshizuka Unsho\NHashi Takaya\NKaida Yuko\NKamiya Hiroshi \NOnozuka Takashi\NTezuka Hideaki \NKiyama Shigeo \NAoki Shiki \NSawaki Ikuya\NFujinuma Kento\NNokubi Naoko
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.53,0:22:53.75,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kienai de aoi tsuki yo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.53,0:22:53.75,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Blue moon, please don't fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.75,0:23:01.62,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Terashidasu kimi hitohira
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.75,0:23:01.62,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It lights up my love just enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:18.85,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Nani hitotsu kawaranai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:18.85,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Everything was routine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.83,0:23:25.14,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Monotone iro no hibi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.83,0:23:25.14,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Monotone days for so long
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.07,0:23:31.14,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Unmei ga tsurete kita
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.07,0:23:31.14,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Fate brought you to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.14,0:23:37.51,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kimi no me ni koi wo shita
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.14,0:23:37.51,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I fell in love with your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.08,0:23:43.47,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikaku ni kanjitai yo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.08,0:23:43.47,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I want to feel you close
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.90,0:23:50.44,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Atatakai te ni furete
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.90,0:23:50.44,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Touching your warm hands
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.68,0:23:56.05,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Aa sugu ni kotoba ni dekitara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.68,0:23:56.05,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Wishing I could put this into words right away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.77,0:24:02.12,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Konnani ai shiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.77,0:24:02.12,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I love you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.58,0:24:08.32,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kakurenai de koigokoro yo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.58,0:24:08.32,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Loving feelings, please don't hide
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.72,0:24:14.10,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kimi dake terashiteru yo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.72,0:24:14.10,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It sheds light only on you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.88,0:24:21.06,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Konya nara sou ieru
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.88,0:24:21.06,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I can say that because tonight is different
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.13,0:24:44.58,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.64,0:24:47.61,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Emergency ascent !\NThe Yamato will act as a decoy !
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.61,0:24:53.26,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I'll show you what your love will allow to live and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.26,0:24:53.86,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.86,0:24:57.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki !
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.11,0:24:58.11,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 09
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.11,0:24:58.11,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(968,684)}Zorder's Demonic Choice

